Melton, David James Elliott and Ash Santos.

12
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:21,000
The film was released on October 29, 2021 by Vertical Entertainment.

13
01:36:41,250 --> 01:36:47,250
The film follows the rowing team of a fictional Ivy League university as they aim to win the
national championship under the tutelage of a new coach, a Vietnam veteran.

14
01:44:07,500 --> 01:44:13,500
The film explores themes of affectation, calm,
candid, cautionary, inspirational.

15
01:51:33,750 --> 01:51:39,750
